{"content_hash": "98cea992996db077", "version_id": 965, "article_id": 97, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "OnePlus Ace 7 Pro adds periscope zoom to its gaming muscle", "title_zh": "一加 Ace 7 Pro 补上潜望长焦，游戏旗舰更全能了", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "mydrivers_ev", "source_url": "https://news.mydrivers.com/1/1165/1165652.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567019001814-57350903e2af?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8YWNlJTIwcHJvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ2MjAwMTB8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Jason Abrams on Unsplash", "author": "Jason Abrams", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@jabrams5?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-green-golf-ball-sitting-on-top-of-a-green-field-EN3AVjMPZWA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(124, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(162, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "8fec7547c198"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-14", "word_count": 230, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "OnePlus has unveiled the Ace 7 Pro, a handset that pairs a fully fledged flagship chip and dual air-cooling with the Ace line's first 3.5x periscope telephoto lens. The company is pitching it as the most well-rounded Ace yet.", "lead_zh": "一加发布了 Ace 7 Pro，这颗机型把满血旗舰芯片、双路风冷和 Ace 系列首颗 3.5 倍潜望长焦凑到了一起。官方称这是 Ace 有史以来最全面的一代。", "preview": "With the standard Ace 7 already boasting an active fan, a 185Hz display and a 9,000mAh battery, OnePlus needed something extra to justify th", "preview_zh": "标准版 Ace 7 已经配了主动风扇、185Hz 屏幕和 9000mAh 电池，一加得再拿出点东西才对得起 Pro 这个后缀。第一个答案是满血版第五代骁龙 8 至尊版，采用第三代 3nm 工艺，第三代 Oryon CPU 双超大核设计，最高主频 4.6GHz。它和标准版的 Vse", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 947, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/97/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 98.225, "size_bytes": 590256, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 270, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@959f3ce/content/data/versions/965.json", "paragraphs": ["With the standard Ace 7 already boasting an active fan, a 185Hz display and a 9,000mAh battery, OnePlus needed something extra to justify the Pro badge. The first answer is a full-spec Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 5, built on a third-generation 3nm process with a dual-prime-core Oryon CPU clocked at up to 4.6GHz. Though it shares an architectural footing with the Vseries chip in the standard model, the Pro gets the complete flagship silicon, giving its cooling system more headroom.", "The second upgrade concerns imaging. Alongside the same 200-megapixel main sensor as the standard model, the Pro swaps the 8-megapixel ultrawide for a 50-megapixel 3.5x periscope telephoto — the first of its kind in the Ace series. For a line long defined by gaming performance, that addition signals a deliberate push into broader everyday use.", "Our review unit came in Midnight Black, whose matte fibreglass back and metal frame cut a more sober figure than the storm-textured 'Breaking Wind' variant. A redesigned 'Storm Island' camera block folds the fan intake into the housing, while a breathing light beneath lends a touch of gaming flair. The 185Hz fourth-generation display, 9,000mAh battery and 100W charging all carry over unchanged.", "In testing, the battery lasted more than 15 hours and recharged fully in 49 minutes. Whether these refinements translate into meaningfully better day-to-day experience is what the full review sets out to establish."], "paragraphs_zh": ["标准版 Ace 7 已经配了主动风扇、185Hz 屏幕和 9000mAh 电池，一加得再拿出点东西才对得起 Pro 这个后缀。第一个答案是满血版第五代骁龙 8 至尊版，采用第三代 3nm 工艺，第三代 Oryon CPU 双超大核设计，最高主频 4.6GHz。它和标准版的 Vseries 芯片架构相近，但 Pro 用的是完整规格的旗舰芯片，给散热留出了更大发挥空间。", "第二项升级在影像。除了和标准版相同的 2 亿像素主摄，Pro 把 800 万像素超广角换成了 5000 万像素 3.5 倍潜望长焦，这也是 Ace 系列头一回。对一个长期以游戏性能立身的系列来说，这颗镜头意味着它开始有意拓展日常使用场景。", "我们拿到的是极夜黑版本，磨砂玻纤背板配金属中框，比风暴纹理的“破风”配色更沉稳。全新“风暴岛”镜头区把风扇进风口融进 Deco，下方还有一条呼吸灯，添了几分电竞味道。185Hz 第四代东方屏、9000mAh 电池和 100W 闪充都原样保留。", "实测续航超过 15 小时，49 分钟即可充满。这些改进究竟能带来多少实际体验上的提升，还有待完整评测来验证。"], "body": "With the standard Ace 7 already boasting an active fan, a 185Hz display and a 9,000mAh battery, OnePlus needed something extra to justify the Pro badge. The first answer is a full-spec Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 5, built on a third-generation 3nm process with a dual-prime-core Oryon CPU clocked at up to 4.6GHz. Though it shares an architectural footing with the Vseries chip in the standard model, the Pro gets the complete flagship silicon, giving its cooling system more headroom.\n\nThe second upgrade concerns imaging. Alongside the same 200-megapixel main sensor as the standard model, the Pro swaps the 8-megapixel ultrawide for a 50-megapixel 3.5x periscope telephoto — the first of its kind in the Ace series. For a line long defined by gaming performance, that addition signals a deliberate push into broader everyday use.\n\nOur review unit came in Midnight Black, whose matte fibreglass back and metal frame cut a more sober figure than the storm-textured 'Breaking Wind' variant. A redesigned 'Storm Island' camera block folds the fan intake into the housing, while a breathing light beneath lends a touch of gaming flair. The 185Hz fourth-generation display, 9,000mAh battery and 100W charging all carry over unchanged.\n\nIn testing, the battery lasted more than 15 hours and recharged fully in 49 minutes. Whether these refinements translate into meaningfully better day-to-day experience is what the full review sets out to establish.", "body_zh": "标准版 Ace 7 已经配了主动风扇、185Hz 屏幕和 9000mAh 电池，一加得再拿出点东西才对得起 Pro 这个后缀。第一个答案是满血版第五代骁龙 8 至尊版，采用第三代 3nm 工艺，第三代 Oryon CPU 双超大核设计，最高主频 4.6GHz。它和标准版的 Vseries 芯片架构相近，但 Pro 用的是完整规格的旗舰芯片，给散热留出了更大发挥空间。\n\n第二项升级在影像。除了和标准版相同的 2 亿像素主摄，Pro 把 800 万像素超广角换成了 5000 万像素 3.5 倍潜望长焦，这也是 Ace 系列头一回。对一个长期以游戏性能立身的系列来说，这颗镜头意味着它开始有意拓展日常使用场景。\n\n我们拿到的是极夜黑版本，磨砂玻纤背板配金属中框，比风暴纹理的“破风”配色更沉稳。全新“风暴岛”镜头区把风扇进风口融进 Deco，下方还有一条呼吸灯，添了几分电竞味道。185Hz 第四代东方屏、9000mAh 电池和 100W 闪充都原样保留。\n\n实测续航超过 15 小时，49 分钟即可充满。这些改进究竟能带来多少实际体验上的提升，还有待完整评测来验证。", "text": "With the standard Ace 7 already boasting an active fan, a 185Hz display and a 9,000mAh battery, OnePlus needed something extra to justify the Pro badge. The first answer is a full-spec Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 5, built on a third-generation 3nm process with a dual-prime-core Oryon CPU clocked at up to 4.6GHz. Though it shares an architectural footing with the Vseries chip in the standard model, the Pro gets the complete flagship silicon, giving its cooling system more headroom. The second upgrade concerns imaging. Alongside the same 200-megapixel main sensor as the standard model, the Pro swaps the 8-megapixel ultrawide for a 50-megapixel 3.5x periscope telephoto — the first of its kind in the Ace series. For a line long defined by gaming performance, that addition signals a deliberate push into broader everyday use. Our review unit came in Midnight Black, whose matte fibreglass back and metal frame cut a more sober figure than the storm-textured 'Breaking Wind' variant. A redesigned 'Storm Island' camera block folds the fan intake into the housing, while a breathing light beneath lends a touch of gaming flair. The 185Hz fourth-generation display, 9,000mAh battery and 100W charging all carry over unchanged. In testing, the battery lasted more than 15 hours and recharged fully in 49 minutes. Whether these refinements translate into meaningfully better day-to-day experience is what the full review sets out to establish.", "vocab": [{"word": "well-rounded", "pos": "adj", "zh": "全面的、均衡的", "note": "形容产品各方面都不短板", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "periscope telephoto", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "潜望式长焦镜头", "note": "手机影像常用术语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "justify", "pos": "verb", "zh": "证明……合理、配得上", "note": "justify the badge 即“对得起这个名号”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "headroom", "pos": "noun", "zh": "余量、发挥空间", "note": "常指性能或预算上的余地", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "architectural footing", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "架构基础", "note": "on the same footing 意为处于同等地位", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "silicon", "pos": "noun", "zh": "芯片、硅片", "note": "新闻中常代指芯片", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "imaging", "pos": "noun", "zh": "影像、成像", "note": "科技报道固定说法", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "swap A for B", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "用 B 替换 A", "note": "注意介词搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "deliberate", "pos": "adj", "zh": "有意的、刻意的", "note": "强调经过考量", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sober", "pos": "adj", "zh": "沉稳的、低调的", "note": "形容设计风格", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "variant", "pos": "noun", "zh": "版本、变体", "note": "指同系列的不同配色或型号", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fold into", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "融入、并入", "note": "形象说法，指结构整合", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "carry over", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "沿用、保留", "note": "指配置从上代继承", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "translate into", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "转化为", "note": "常指投入变成实际效果", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-14T01:33:28.391504", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "With", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.362, "sm": 250, "em": 362, "cs": 0, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "the", "s": 0.362, "e": 0.45, "sm": 362, "em": 449, "cs": 5, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "standard", "s": 0.45, "e": 0.875, "sm": 450, "em": 875, "cs": 9, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "Ace", "s": 0.875, "e": 1.137, "sm": 875, "em": 1137, "cs": 18, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "7", "s": 1.137, "e": 1.55, "sm": 1137, "em": 1549, "cs": 22, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "already", "s": 1.55, "e": 1.925, "sm": 1550, "em": 1925, "cs": 24, "ce": 31, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "boasting", "s": 1.925, "e": 2.312, "sm": 1925, "em": 2312, "cs": 32, "ce": 40, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "an", "s": 2.312, "e": 2.413, "sm": 2312, "em": 2412, "cs": 41, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "active", "s": 2.413, "e": 2.8, "sm": 2412, "em": 